 // AnalogRX: sparkle repair, for every decoder in the process (takes effect at once). The white / black
-// sparkles of a weak signal are FM "clicks": they happen where the carrier's envelope collapses. The front end
-// marks those instants; the decoder, which draws each line about a line after it arrives, patches the picture
